Belt Tournament Champions" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/15/MSOC_vsUSC_Nov15_2026_AM-104.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 7 West Virginia University men's soccer team claimed its second trophy of the season on Sunday with a 4-0 win over South Carolina in the Sun Belt Tournament Final. The Mountaineers improve to 13-2-4 overall this season while the Gamecocks fall to 12-6-2. It is the second time in three seasons that West Virginia has swept the Sun Belt titles and is also the seventh conference tournament championship in program history.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/15/MSOC_vsUSC_Nov15_2026_AM-104.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/15/MSOC_vsUSC_Nov15_2026_AM-104.jpg"><media:title>Sun Belt Tournament Champions</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/15/MSOC_vsUSC_Nov15_2026_AM-104.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:03:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59707</s:story_id></item><item><title>No. 23 West Virginia Defeats Brown, Hofstra to Remain Undefeated</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/15/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-defeats-brown-hofstra-to-remain-undefeated</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/15/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-defeats-brown-hofstra-to-remain-undefeated</guid><category>Wrestling</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team dominated Mercyhurst, 52-0, to open dual competition at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., on Saturday." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-50.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team swept a tri-meet against Brown and Hofstra at the Pizzitola Sports Center in Providence, Rhode Island, on Sunday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-50.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-50.jpg"><media:title>The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team dominated Mercyhurst, 52-0, to open dual competition at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., on Saturday.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-50.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:56:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>18</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59706</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Come Up Short in Five-Set Battle with UCF</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/15/volleyball-mountaineers-come-up-short-in-five-set-battle-with-ucf</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/15/volleyball-mountaineers-come-up-short-in-five-set-battle-with-ucf</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia volleyball loses to UCF in five sets in Morgantown" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/15/DAK08670.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The West Virginia University volleyball team (13-11, 6-8 Big 12) fell to UCF, 3-2, on Sunday afternoon inside Hope Coliseum. The Mountaineers dropped the five-set match by scores of 25-18, 22-25, 26-28, 25-20 and 11-15.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/15/DAK08670.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/15/DAK08670.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia volleyball loses to UCF in five sets in Morgantown</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/15/DAK08670.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:10:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59705</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>